The numbers is a list of 2, 1, 2.
Sort numbers.
The spot is the last position of numbers.
The best is 0.
Repeat while spot is at least 2.
The first is item (spot minus 2) of numbers.
The second is item (spot minus 1) of numbers.
The third is item spot of numbers.
If first plus second is more than third, set best to first plus second plus third, stop.
Subtract 1 from spot.

Show best.
